  "data": {
    "summary": "This weapon ability works only when the target unit has the **PSYKER** keyword. Against such a unit, whenever an attack with the weapon scores a **critical wound**, that attack's sequence stops, and the target unit takes a number of mortal wounds matching the weapon's D, applied once those attacks' normal damage is resolved.\n\nNo more than 1 model can be damaged by the mortal wounds from each critical wound, and any surplus from that attack is lost.",
